{"path":"language/continue","title":"continue statement","titleHtml":"<code>continue</code> statement","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/continue","section":"language","kind":"page","summary":"Causes the remaining portion of the enclosing for, range-for, while or do-while loop body to be skipped.","html":"<p>Causes the remaining portion of the enclosing <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/for\">for</a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/range-for\">range-for</a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/while\">while</a> or <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/do\">do-while</a> loop body to be skipped.\n</p><p>Used when it is otherwise awkward to ignore the remaining portion of the loop using conditional statements.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Syntax\">Syntax</h3>\n<table class=\"t-sdsc-begin\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\" class=\"t-sdsc-sep\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-sdsc\">\n<td class=\"t-sdsc-nopad\"> <span class=\"t-spar\">attr</span> ﻿<span class=\"t-mark\">(optional)</span> <code><b>continue</b></code> <code><b>;</b></code>\n</td>\n<td class=\"t-sdsc-nopad\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"t-sdsc-nopad\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\" class=\"t-sdsc-sep\">\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Explanation\">Explanation</h3>\n<p>The <code>continue</code> statement causes a jump, as if by <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/goto\">goto</a> to the end of the loop body (it may only appear within the loop body of <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/for\">for</a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/range-for\">range-for</a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/while\">while</a>, and <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/do\">do-while</a> loops).\n</p><p>More precisely,\n</p><p>For <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/while\">while</a> loop, it acts as\n</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">while</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"coMULTI\">/* ... */</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n   <span class=\"co1\">// ...</span>\n   <span class=\"kw1\">continue</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// acts as goto contin;</span>\n   <span class=\"co1\">// ...</span>\n   contin<span class=\"sy4\">:;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>For <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/do\">do-while</a> loop, it acts as:\n</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">do</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// ...</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">continue</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// acts as goto contin;</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// ...</span>\n    contin<span class=\"sy4\">:;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span> <span class=\"kw1\">while</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"coMULTI\">/* ... */</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></code></pre>\n<p>For <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/for\">for</a> and <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/range-for\">range-for</a> loop, it acts as:\n</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"coMULTI\">/* ... */</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// ...</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">continue</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// acts as goto contin;</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// ...</span>\n    contin<span class=\"sy4\">:;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"Keywords\">Keywords</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/continue\"><code>continue</code></a>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> i <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> i <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">10</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>i<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>i <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">5</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"kw1\">continue</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> i <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>      <span class=\"co1\">// this statement is skipped each time i&nbsp;!= 5</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> j <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2</span> <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> j<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>j<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> k <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> k <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">5</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>k<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"co1\">// only this loop is affected by continue</span>\n        <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>k <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n                <span class=\"kw1\">continue</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n            <span class=\"co1\">// this statement is skipped each time k == 3:</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'('</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> j <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">','</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> k <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\") \"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>5\n(0,0) (0,1) (0,2) (0,4) (1,0) (1,1) (1,2) (1,4)</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/language/continue\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>continue</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Syntax","id":"Syntax"},{"depth":3,"text":"Explanation","id":"Explanation"},{"depth":3,"text":"Keywords","id":"Keywords"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"language","title":"C++ language"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"continue statement","children":[{"label":"Syntax"},{"label":"Explanation","note":"The continue statement causes a jump, as if by goto to the end of the loop body (it may only appear within the loop body of for, range-for, while, and…"},{"label":"Keywords","note":"continue"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also"}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":264,"codeBlockCount":5}
